# Build products of "make" (UTILS/make_tool, make_tool_hier, make_tool_proto).
# These are UTILS/*.nopath with $BEEHOME and a use lib line prepended, so they
# are specific to the directory they were built in and they embed the git commit
# count as the release-ID.  That means they change on every commit whether or not
# any source changed -- run make after cloning rather than tracking them.
/electron
/electron_hier
/electron_proto
/electron_auth
/electron.lnx.bin

# Session logs and command logs written next to the tool, and by the tests.
electron.log*
electron.cmd*

# Container images built by INSTALL/podman/Makefile.  Each pair is a couple of
# GB: podman save writes oci-*.tar, apptainer build turns it into a .sif.
*.sif
INSTALL/podman/oci-*.tar

# Python bytecode cache, e.g. from the 3RDBIN placers being imported.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor leftovers.  Three vim swap files were committed with the original
# import and sat in the tree for years; they carry the buffer contents plus the
# username, hostname and home directory of whoever had the file open.
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
